url: "https://github.com/thefourceprinciples/coherence-under-constraint"
commit: "58fedab3b866fbcaceb12bd62ada618c63dde811"
abstract: >-
  Coherence Under Constraint (CUC) is a formal research framework for studying
  how organized systems persist, fail, recover, and transform under declared
  constraints, perturbations, boundaries, throughput conditions, and
  degradation processes. Version 0.2 separates organization, viability,
  coherence generation, persistence, and return; registers falsifiable
  hypotheses; and defines a reproducible experimental program.
keywords:
  - coherence
  - constraint
  - persistence
  - complex systems
  - dynamical systems
  - synchronization
  - resilience
  - systems theory
  - emergence
  - reproducible research
